One medium dog: kennel area 6 m², activity area 15 m²;
total kennel area = 6 × 3 = 18 m²;
activity area (shared by 3, with a diminishing factor) = 15 × (1 + (3−1)×0.5) = 15 × 2 = 30 m²;
boarding 20 days > 14 days → activity area ×1.2 = 36 m²;
total area required = 18 + 36 = 54.0 m² (single kennel about 2.5 × 2.4 × 2 m).
